      "message": "fix(csr): move HPM access control description to M-mode CSRs\n\nMove detailed privilege access control descriptions (tables involving mcounteren, scounteren, hcounteren) from Unprivileged HPM counters (hpmcounterN) to Machine-mode HPM counters (mhpmcounterN). Update HPM counter descriptions to reference the M-mode counterparts for access control details.\n\nCloses #1533\n\nSigned-off-by: krrish175-byte <krrishbiswas175@gmail.com>",
